# Design Rules

Spec: `design/free-body/README.md`. Tokens live in `src/styles/global.css`.

## Tokens

- ALL color, spacing, and type scale are CSS variables. No ad-hoc hex in components.
- Palette: `--paper` #E9EFE2, `--cell` #F3F6EF, `--line` #9DB896, `--ink` #1F2B27,
  `--red` #B5392A.
- Spacing on the 18 px cell; major every 5 cells.
- Two families only: Space Grotesk (display) and IBM Plex Mono (labels, notes).

## Emphasis

- Red once per view for revision marks, weather cancelled/moved, or force-like
  callouts. Not for body text.
- Graph-paper ground comes from tokens; do not invent a second texture system.

## Banned patterns

- Wellness stock art (lotuses, mandalas, aura gradients).
- Soft shadows, large radii, purple gradients.
- A third font family.
- Dark mode toggle (v0 is light / paper only unless an ADR changes it).
